341358 1113 #uuid "da59e353-90f8-5631-b467-4aff835f19bc" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341358 1145 "А second-order linear differential equation has the form\n\n$$\na(x){y}^{″}+b(x){y}^{′}+c(x)y=f(x).\n$$\n\nLet's look at each equation in turn.\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{e}^{2y}{y}^{″}-{x}^{2}{y}^{′}+3=0\n$$\n\nis **NOT** linear because it contains the nonlinear term ${e}^{2y}{y}^{″}.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{e}^{x}{y}^{″}+4{y}^{′}-x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x=2\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)={e}^{x},b(x)=4,c(x)=0,$ and $f(x)=2+x\\operatorname{sin}⁡x.$\n\n- The equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}-2x{y}^{′}+5y=x\n$$\n\nis a second-order linear ODE with $a(x)=1,b(x)=-2x,c(x)=5,$ and $f(x)=x.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341360 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341361 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341362 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341363 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341364 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1041 "selection" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341360 13194139535280 true] [17592186341359 1110 #uuid "d52c0b07-90f8-5624-8c46-8cc2e627366a" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341360 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341360 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341360 1111 #uuid "d864a1be-7032-5c3a-b185-ee874f9a65b5" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341361 1034 "I only" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341361 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341361 1111 #uuid "d6c69b78-4c10-56a9-a669-f96e1a554d28" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341362 1034 "III only" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341362 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341362 1111 #uuid "3e81ce27-b077-5b33-8b4d-e53f5d7bc5ae" 13194139535280 tru