 $x.$\n\n- Writing the equation\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,y+9=0\n$$\n\nin the form $a{y}^{″}+b{y}^{′}+cy=f,$ we have\n\n$$\n{y}^{″}+\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x)\\,y=-9.\n$$\n\nThis equation is $\\text{inhomogeneous}$ since, for the right-hand side, we have $f(x)=-9,$ which is different from zero." 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341408 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341409 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1041 "field-1" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341408 13194139535280 true] [17592186341407 1110 #uuid "67d1ac7f-49ac-53f3-b2b5-97f2c1011a54" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341408 1034 "homogeneous" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341408 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341408 1111 #uuid "d6945ac5-5b14-50da-ba3a-e02a47e25203" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341409 1034 "inhomogeneous" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341409 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341409 1111 #uuid "ace65b49-4419-5718-8126-2e2057f2ea39" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341411 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1000 #edb/ref 17592186341412 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1041 "field-2" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1104 #edb/ref 17592186341411 13194139535280 true] [17592186341410 1110 #uuid "98980f04-b0e7-5aa8-9878-0137594db6fd" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341411 1034 "homogeneous" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341411 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341411 1111 #uuid "6422240b-f86a-5471-9ed1-f86e721a8810" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341412 1034 "inhomogeneous" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341412 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535280 true] [17592186341412 1111 #uuid "694551d3-1a8a-5eb8-8650-df6f36571d69" 13194139535280 true] [17592186341413 1000 #edb/